# Escape twice over an answer streaming whole lines (the lines already shown
# stay, the cancelled line follows them), Ctrl-D while an answer streams (not
# an exit), and Ctrl-C with a draft over a running turn: the first press takes
# the draft only, the second stops the turn and arms the exit.
gateway interrupt-lines.json
wait 2
type stream lines
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap mid
key Escape
wait 0.3
snap esc1
key Escape
wait 0.4
snap esc2
wait 1.5
snap esc2-later
type stream words
key Enter
wait 1
key C-d
wait 0.5
snap cd-streaming
type draft text
wait 0.3
snap draft
key C-c
wait 0.3
snap draft-cc
key C-c
wait 0.4
snap draft-cc2
wait 1
snapfull end
gwlog
